sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React app
    participant API as api
    participant P as planner
    participant R as routing
    participant W as weather
    participant K as risk

    UI->>API: POST /api/plan (places, departure, weight, interval)
    API->>API: validate input, check the service area
    API->>P: plan_trip(...)
    P->>R: find_routes(origin, destination)
    R-->>P: 3 routes (cached 30 min)
    P->>P: place checkpoints and ETAs on each route
    P->>P: pick weather grid sizes within the location budget
    P->>W: load(all checkpoint cells + heatmap cells)
    W-->>P: hourly series per cell (cached 30 min)
    loop every checkpoint
        P->>W: conditions at the checkpoint's ETA
        P->>K: assess(conditions, weight)
    end
    P->>P: summarise, rank, explain, build 49 heatmap hours
    P-->>API: trip plan
    API-->>UI: JSON (gzip)
